# Lintel does not read an API key from the environment.
# Open Settings in the app and store the key there.
# Desktop builds keep it in the user config directory.
# Browser sessions keep it in local storage.
# The key is never written into a .lintel project file.
#
# Optional documentation only — these variables are not required:
# LINTEL_AI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# LINTEL_AI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
